<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.2">
<l>cittira kuttaṉe ḻuttāl teṉpulak kōṉpoṟi yoṟṟi</l>
<l>vaittavi lacciṉai māṟṟit tūtuva rōṭi yoḷittār</l>
<l>muttut tiraikkaṭaṟ cērppaṉ mūtaṟi vāḷar mutalvaṉ</l>
<l>pattark kamuta ṉaṭiyēṉ paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>By stamping the letter of the king of the underworld</l>
<l rend="indent">with Citragupta’s seal</l>
<l>[Yama’s] messengers altered the seal that had been placed,</l>
<l rend="indent">[then] ran away and hid.</l>
<l>I am a servant to the chief of the rolling sea [full of] pearls,</l>
<l rend="indent">the Lord of those who master the old knowledge,</l>
<l>the nectar of devotees.</l>
<l rend="indent">Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
